      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Elder Rowan Meadowlight.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 2, power rating 4 → CR 1 as a spellcaster. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Fallen Druid</strong> — Veridian Grove Druid Circle</p><p>Status: Deceased — died under suspicious circumstances in Veridian Grove</p><p>Elder Rowan Meadowlight was a respected druid of the Veridian Grove who died on the same day as the Swiftsoul explosion, with Archie Miser found near the scene. The prosecution claims Archie caused his death through reckless magic or deliberate silencing of a witness. The defense evidence suggests the Elder was killed by a sophisticated third party who sabotaged the Grove's ancient wards specifically to frame Archie—the same people responsible for the Swiftsoul explosion.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Staff</strong> — “The Fallen Druid”</li><li><strong>Guild Spellcasting</strong> — “The Elder's Staff: The staff fragment found near Meadowlight's body shows impact damage inconsistent with fire—it was SHATTERED by kinetic force, with embedded traces of cold-forged silver alloy used in anti-druidic”</li><li><strong>Vampiric Bite</strong> — “The Veridian Grove Druid Circle stood apart from the vampire-werewolf conflicts, the Guild schemes, and the Kingdom's sometimes brutal pragmatism.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/elder_meadowlight</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/elder_meadowlight</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
